	finite-dimensional space, with finite outcome sets $\mathcal A$ and
	$\mathcal B$, respectively. Assume, for every $a,b$,
	$[X_1(a),Z_2(b)]=[Z_1(b),X_2(a)]=[Z_1(b),Z_2(b)]=0$.
