		\E_{x,z}\sum_{a,b}\|((Z_bX_a)_{p_1}-(X_aZ_b)_{p_2})\hat\psi\|^2
		\le C_2\eps,
	\]
	for universal constants $C_0,C_1,C_2\ge1$, in every projective setting
	and for every indicated placement. These are formalization-only
	estimates for the direct field-valued construction.
\end{lemma}
